              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LED87"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not use an egg but substituted for 1tbs baking powder. I found this idea on a vegan website. I made veggies for me and shrimp for the DH.I made him shrimp tempura sushi. I used coconut oil and my cast iron skillet. This recipe was awesome!! I flipped my veggies &amp; shrimp in order to get a nice golden color on both sides.",
